>> Animal := Ima musuq.
>> Factory := Ima musuq.

Animal patapi: ['musuq'] ruway: {
	>> animal := kikin musuq.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal patapi: ['sound:'] ruway: { :s
	ñuqap sound := s.
}.

Animal patapi: ['sound'] ruway: { <- ñuqap sound.
}.

>> Dog := Ima musuq.
>> Cat := Ima musuq.

Dog patapi: ['musuq'] ruway: { <- Animal musuq sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat patapi: ['musuq'] ruway: { <- Animal musuq sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Lluqsiy qillqay: Dog musuq sound, sayay.
Lluqsiy qillqay: Cat musuq sound, sayay.

Factory patapi: ['mix:and:'] ruway: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal musuq sound: (
		( beast1 sound manta: 0 suni: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound manta: 2 suni: 5 )
	).
}.

Lluqsiy qillqay: (Factory mix: Dog musuq and: Cat musuq) sound, sayay.
